  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Fund to Ugandan Transgender youth.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is based in western uganda and our aim is to establish a long term shelter , nutritional support , hygienic supplies and utilities  for rural transgender youth and gender diverse youth in western Uganda  during these difficult times as the Anti homosexuality bill 2023 is forcing landlords who have been tolerating transgender and gender diverse  persons  to evict them from their premises for fear of getting arrested if the bill becomes becomes law.</narrative>
  </description>
